{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349680/extras/d423c7712a8c1c70131f1a3af49db4a1.avif?t=1756796076\" width=1150 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m <strong>Rookie</strong>, the new guy on the space courier ship <strong>BallEx</strong>. Life onboard was already chaotic, but after crashing on a hostile planet, it\u2019s up to me to recover the lost cargo and the parts we need to get the ship flying again\u2026 assuming the crew doesn\u2019t drive me insane first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349680/extras/be0a3ad4f981bfb530fb7f5d082fc0de.avif?t=1756796076\" width=1150 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least I\u2019m not completely alone. <strong>H.A.P.P.Y.</strong>, the ship\u2019s over-eager AI, insists on tagging along. With its \u201chelp,\u201d I shift tetrominos to reshape the terrain, blast enemies when things get hairy, and puzzle my way through whatever obstacles this planet throws at me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, I stumble across eccentric crewmates and passengers, uncover secrets best left buried, and try to keep what\u2019s left of my sanity. The game is turn-based, which gives me time to plan every move\u2026 though if I overthink it, I\u2019ll probably just dig myself into a hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349680/extras/7caf910cd651e4b21270341e5422649f.avif?t=1756796076\" width=1176 height=585 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure unfolds chapter by chapter, each one packed with new puzzles, hazards, and plenty of questionable life choices. <strong>Chapter 1</strong> is just the beginning \u2014 and trust me, the crew has more ways to ruin my day than this planet ever could.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349680/extras/storepage_footer?t=1756796076\" /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1349680?t=1756796076","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349680/f5a9578b9ef27d4313d8157660a1d7c82c2194e4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756796076","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349680/84cfcf2971279559fdf457da00d68fd6a1dddbff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756796076","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349680/84cfcf2971279559fdf457da00d68fd6a1dddbff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756796076","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1437800,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Play free Prologue!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349680/extras/d423c7712a8c1c70131f1a3af49db4a1.avif?t=1756796076\" width=1150 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m <strong>Rookie</strong>, the new guy on the space courier ship <strong>BallEx</strong>. Life onboard was already chaotic, but after crashing on a hostile planet, it\u2019s up to me to recover the lost carg